: Caspian Halvorsen is now their go-to person at Marrow Agrisupply for escalations on the Nettle rollout. I didn't do anything else, since they said no action was needed.\n\nThe workspace brain saves our DMs automatically and shows them only to Hollis, so this is on record for them. I won't mention it in channels or in anyone else's conversations.\n```","id":3,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Marrow Agrisupply for escalations on the Nettle rollout is Caspian Halvorsen from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
